    narr:narration """This call records a ruling on how weekly reactions reach people. It opens with [the frame introducing the ruling](narr:Expr_20261007_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hed495c46f84c_1), then the ruling itself: [the per-run bundle stays and Fridays add one weekly roll-up](narr:Expr_20261007_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hed495c46f84c_2). A question follows — [whether the roll-up replaces the bundle](narr:Expr_20261007_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hed495c46f84c_3) — answered by [the clarification that the bundle is for the run, the roll-up for the week](narr:Expr_20261007_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hed495c46f84c_4). The arc closes with [the rejected daily-digest alternative](narr:Expr_20261007_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hed495c46f84c_5).""" ;
